WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.100
Do the seals, the trumpets and the bowls happen one after another?

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:17.600
Many readers say no. Each series ends in the same place: the world shaking, and God appearing.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:27.160
So it is less a countdown, and more a story told three times, each time closer to the heart.
